/P 60 0 R
/T (The single-cycle 23-bit Mini MIPS processor and custom Python assembler were successfully designed, implemented, and validated. All 17 instructions executed within their respective control states, and the assembler properly handled two- pass resolution for labels and control transfers. )
/E (The single-cycle 23-bit Mini MIPS processor and custom Python assembler were successfully designed, implemented, and validated. All 17 instructions executed within their respective control states, and the assembler properly handled two- pass resolution for labels and control transfers. )
